osts after Thanksgiving parade rearranged&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckd71ypy9e8eo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:15:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 约翰·辛普森：随着寒冷天气的到来，乌克兰已屈服，但仍未被打破</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3pw4yrr8kz9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>乌克兰即将迎来另一个毁灭性的冬天，但问题依然存在：这一切将如何结束？&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3pw4yrr8kz9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;约翰·辛普森：随着寒冷天气的到来，乌克兰已屈服，但仍未被打破&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：John Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but still unbroken as freezing weather sets in&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3pw4yrr8kz9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:18:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 降雨缓解了巴西主要大豆产区对厄尔尼诺现象的担忧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region</link><description>巴西顶级大豆产区深处一片生机勃勃、绿叶茂盛的绿色植物海洋，缓解了人们对厄尔尼诺现象会给世界顶级大豆生产国带来农作物损失的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region'&gt;降雨缓解了巴西主要大豆产区对厄尔尼诺现象的担忧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rains Ease El Niño Crop Fears in Brazil’s Top Soybean Region&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 达纳·特尔西 (Dana Telsey) 表示，实体店在体验方面卷土重来</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/brick-and-mortar-making-a-comeback-says-dana-telsey-video</link><description>黑色星期五在东海岸的开局令人沮丧，因为暴风雨天